    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="pm_d54">

                <pb facs="pm_d54-1" n="1" xml:id="pm_d54-1"/>

                <head>PM–54. Memorandum from the Secretary of State to the President<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="pm_d54-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1960-09-08">September 8,
                        1960</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Relationship Between the Chief of the United States Mission in Panama and
                        the Governor of the Panama Canal Zone</item>
                </list>
                <p>At the meeting in your office on September 1st Secretary Brucker and I indicated our agreement on the
                    primacy of the Chief of the United States <pb facs="1067" n="979" type="typeset"
                        xml:id="pg979"/> Mission in Panama over the Governor of the Panama Canal
                    Zone in matters affecting the relations between the United States and the
                    Republic of Panama or any other nation. We said further that we would submit for
                    your consideration draft letters to be sent by you to each of us confirming this
                    relationship. I enclose for your consideration these draft letters.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="pm_d54-f2"/></p>
                <p>Secretary Brucker concurs in this
                    memorandum.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold">CHRISTIAN A.
                                HERTER</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Christian A. Herter</hi></signed></closer>


                <pb facs="1068" n="980" type="typeset" xml:id="pg980"/>



                <xi:include href="pm_d54-a1.xml" xpointer="pm_d54-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="pm_d54-a2.xml" xpointer="pm_d54-a2"/>
