                    Long.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#pm_d54-f2" n="2" xml:id="pm_d54-f2-content">
                <p>On September 12, the President signed and transmitted the texts of these letters
                    to Secretary of State Herter and to
                    Secretary of the Amy Brucker.
                    (Eisenhower Library, Whitman File, Dulles-Herter Series)</p>
            </note>
